On December 12, 2023, the first debate between presidential candidates was held at the KPU RI Office in [[Jakarta]]. In keeping with the idea of a town hall meeting discussion,<ref>{{Cite news |last=Indonesia |first=C. N. N. |title=KPU: Debat Perdana Pilpres 2024 Pakai Konsep Town Hall Meeting |url=https://www.cnnindonesia.com/nasional/20231208190205-617-1034874/kpu-debat-perdana-pilpres-2024-pakai-konsep-town-hall-meeting |access-date=2023-12-13 |website=nasional |language=id-ID}}</ref>  this debate introduced the three presidential candidate pairs participating in the 2024 election, although in actually just the three presidential candidates participated. The themes of the debate were Government, Law, Human Rights, Corruption Eradication, Strengthening Democracy, Improving Public Services, and Harmony among Citizens.<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |last=Humas KPU |date=2023-11-29 |title=KPU Siap Gelar Debat Capres 3 Kali dan Cawapres 2 Kali |url=https://www.kpu.go.id/berita/baca/12125/kpu-siap-gelar-debat-capres-3-kali-dan-cawapres-2-kali |access-date=2023-12-12 |website=KPU 21}}</ref> [[TVRI]] anchors, Ardianto Wijaya and Valerina Daniel were appointed as moderators at the premiere of this debate.<ref name=":1807369">{{Cite news |last=Juli Hantoro  |title=KPU Tetapkan Ardianto Wijaya dan Valerina Daniel sebagai Moderator Debat Pilpres 2024 |url=https://nasional.tempo.co/read/1807369/kpu-tetapkan-ardianto-wijaya-dan-valerina-daniel-sebagai-moderator-debat-pilpres-2024 |website=Tempo.co|date=9 December 2023 }}</ref>

The first debate presented the three presidential candidates debating [[law]], [[bureaucracy]], and [[democratic system]]. Anies and Muhaimin appeared compactly wearing white shirts with black suits with stickers “AMIN” on their chests, Prabowo wore a light blue shirt as their partner's signature color matching with his partner Gibran and there was a small pin pinned on his chest,<ref>{{Cite web |last=Dewanti |first=Yolanda Putri |title=Beda Gaya Busana Anies Baswedan, Prabowo Subianto, Ganjar Pranowo di Debat Capres Pertama |url=https://wartakota.tribunnews.com/2023/12/12/beda-gaya-busana-anies-baswedan-prabowo-subianto-ganjar-pranowo-di-debat-capres-pertama |website=Tribun News |language=id}}</ref> Ganjar appeared wearing a white shirt that read “sat, set”, while Mahfud who wore a white shirt that read “tas, tes” with a picture of a judicial scale on his left chest.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Sari |first=Brigitta Belia Permata |title=Tiba di Markas TPN, Ganjar Pakai Baju 'Sat-Set' dan Mahfud 'Tas-Tes' |url=https://news.detik.com/pemilu/d-7086018/tiba-di-markas-tpn-ganjar-pakai-baju-sat-set-dan-mahfud-tas-tes |website=Detik News |language=id}}</ref> Anies and Prabowo clashed during the democracy debate. Anies stated that there were still restrictions on [[freedom of speech]].<ref>{{Cite news |last=Wiryono |first=Singgih |title=Anies Sebut Rakyat Tak Percaya pada Proses Demokrasi Saat Ini |url=https://nasional.kompas.com/read/2023/12/12/20585791/anies-sebut-rakyat-tak-percaya-pada-proses-demokrasi-saat-ini |website=Kompas |date=12 December 2023 |language=id}}</ref> Prabowo responded by dismissing the issue. He insisted that democracy under Jokowi's administration was good, even according to him, it was because of the democratic process that Anies could become governor of Jakarta.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Muliawati |first=Anggi |title=Aksi Joget Prabowo Usai Tanggapi Anies soal Penguatan Demokrasi |url=https://news.detik.com/pemilu/d-7086383/aksi-joget-prabowo-usai-tanggapi-anies-soal-penguatan-demokrasi |website=Detik News |language=id}}</ref> Anies replied that Prabowo was considered “unable to stand to be in the opposition camp” as an honorable position.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Muliawati |first=Firda Dwi |title=Debat Memanas! Anies: Pak Prabowo tidak Tahan Menjadi Oposisi |url=https://www.cnbcindonesia.com/news/20231212205409-4-496652/debat-memanas-anies-pak-prabowo-tidak-tahan-menjadi-oposisi |website=CNBC Indonesia |language=id}}</ref>

