The fourth presidential and vice presidential debate took place on January 21, 2024, at the Jakarta Convention Center, Jakarta. Taking the concept of a modified town-hall meeting,<ref>{{Cite news |last=Kamila |first=Alfa |title=Jadwal Lengkap Debat Pilpres Keempat, Tema, Lokasi, Panelis dan Moderator |url=https://www.jawapos.com/politik/013791350/jadwal-lengkap-debat-pilpres-keempat-tema-lokasi-panelis-dan-moderator?page=1 |work=Jawa Pos |language=id}}</ref> this debate participated by the vice presidential candidates with a discussion format similar to the previous debates. The themes of this debate are Sustainable Development, Natural Resources, Environment, Energy, Food, Agrarian, and Indigenous Peoples and Villages. In previous debates, the moderators were paired with a man and a woman, however on this debate, two women from [[SCTV (TV network)|SCTV's]] [[Liputan 6]] editor-in-chief Retno Pinasti and [[Metro TV (Indonesian TV network)|MetroTV's]] news anchor Zilvia Iskandar were appointed as moderators on the fourth debate.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Priyasmoro |first=Muhammad Radityo |title=Profil Retno Pinasti dan Zilvia Iskandar, Moderator Debat Keempat Pilpres 2024 |url=https://www.liputan6.com/pemilu/read/5507598/profil-retno-pinasti-dan-zilvia-iskandar-moderator-debat-keempat-pilpres-2024 |work=Liputan 6 News |language=id}}</ref>

Candidates number 1 Anies Baswedan and Muhaimin Iskandar came with white shirts without a black suit. Candidate pair number 2 Prabowo Subianto and Gibran Rakabuming Raka compactly wore the same light blue shirt typical of their pair's colors, Prabowo was seen layering his light blue shirt with a dark blue suit. Meanwhile, Gibran was seen wearing a blue shirt with an image similar to the Straw Hat “[[One Piece]]” group flag on his left chest. Candidate pair number 3 Ganjar Pranowo and Mahfud MD were present wearing mountain people costumes specifically designed and tailored to the environmental theme. In the early session, Ganjar-Mahfud wore a green long-sleeved shirt complete with a cream-colored scraft, and the slogan Sat Set on the left chest and Number 3 on the right chest. During the press conference, Ganjar-Mahfud wore a green shirt combined with a vest with the Sat-Set slogan on the left chest, and Number 3 on the right chest.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Pradita |first=Utama |title=Potret Busana Pasangan Capres-Cawapres di Debat Keempat |url=https://news.detik.com/foto-news/d-7153211/potret-busana-pasangan-capres-cawapres-di-debat-keempat |work=Detik News |language=id}}</ref> The debate was between vice-presidential candidates Muhaimin Iskandar, Gibran Rakabuming Raka and Mahfud MD.

In this fourth debate, the vice-presidential candidates attacked each other about food estate, nickel downstreaming to the seizure of indigenous areas, from the revocation of mining IUPs with many mafias, nickel, lithium-ion and lithium phosphate, carbon tax and renewable energy, agrarian reform, village development, community customary rights and others.<ref>{{Cite news |last= |first= |title=Rangkuman debat cawapres Pilpres 2024: Saling serang soal food estate, hilirisasi nikel hingga perampasan wilayah adat |url=https://www.bbc.com/indonesia/articles/czdl9p8pjyno |work=BBC News |language=id}}</ref> Moreover, the interesting part of the fourth debate was [[Thomas Lembong]]'s name mentioned by Gibran in response to Muhaimin's note, and the term “Greenflation” when Gibran asked Mahfud MD, and Gibran's gimmick to find answers from Mahfud MD.<ref>{{Cite news |last= |first= |title=Pengamat: Debat Keempat Pilpres 2024 Lebih Tampilkan Gimmick ketimbang Substansi |url=https://www.kompas.tv/nasional/478842/pengamat-debat-keempat-pilpres-2024-lebih-tampilkan-gimmick-ketimbang-substansi |work=Kompas TV |language=id}}</ref>

